        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Greetings ORQ members:</P><P>     I am a level 55 ranger of Healer's United and would love help on a Hole raid to kill Jaeil the Insane :)  I have never been to the Hole, but I heard maybe 2 solid groups could do it.  I am thinking Thursday Nov. 22 around 5pm PST to do this (if this date isn't good I am open to changes).  I am open to and I encourage feedback from people who have done this raid to let me know techniques, and all that fun stuff.  Also, a suggestion from my elder ranger's of what classes and how many raiders I need to gather would be helpful.  I will post this message on a few boards of ORQ guilds, but I will use the ORQ message board to organize and update.  Thanks for any help, and please get back to me, either here, in the game, or by e-mail to <a href="mailto:buhbuh777@yahoo.com.">buhbuh777@yahoo.com.</a>  Thanks, and hope to hear from you all soon :)</P><P> </font></td>
