        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I'd love to go Buhbuh, there are a couple epic things I need in the Hole as well, so all the more reason to tag along, but alas Thursdays are when our HoT raids are, if you happen to move it to Wed. or Friday, I'm good to go...</P><P>Moegid Skinflayer<BR>55th Revenant of Innoruuk</P><P>Evil is good, evil is your friend  <img src=icon_smile_evil.gif border=0 align=middle><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
