        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Thursday night is my regular Temple of Veeshan Halls of Testing raid.  I will not be able to attend, I am sorry.</P><P>The Hole has been problematic in the past.  It is a lot more difficult than a lot of people think.  Juror had the great idea of COTHing most of the people down to the epic mob and fighting there rather than trying to battle all the way down.  For four to five groups of levels 50+ we were routed by some very nasty packs of mobs, mainly rock golems and elementals.  Rock golems are just about 100% unmezzable and will quickly crush your support forces if they are not off-tanked.</P><P><a href="http://www.mikeshea.net/everquest" target="_blank"><img src="http://mikeshea.net/everquest/images/loral_sig.jpg" border=0></a><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
