        <br><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0>
        <br>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>5678 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="white" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;11/12/2001&nbsp;:&nbsp; 13:33:58</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=5"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://healersunited.com" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Juror's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Sorry I didn't have a lot of time to talk to you about raid yesterday, Buhbuh.  There is so much for a shaman to do between pulls and spam is heavy during combat in Sky.</P><P>A few suggestions... <BR>Change date to Friday, Nov. 30th so more ubers can come.<BR>Combine forces to make this an epics (as opposed to epic) event.  There are several classes (incl. SHAMAN!) who need items from the Hole and it's not easy to gather the forces needed to get them since mobs you need to kill are deep in the zone.<BR>Invite twice as many people than you need (esp. for critical classes) since they will not all show up.<BR>Do your homework (there is a lot of reading material out there.)</P><P>While the CotH method is the least risky/quickest, it requires very specific people (mage with CotH, Brell cleric who has never fought there before, and Brell rogue capable of sneak/hide who has never fought there before.)  You can fight your way down but then you need at least two to three well-balanced groups of 50+ and it takes a couple hours.  That means recruiting a FD puller, scout, mezzers, tankage (incl. one for focus), healers/rezzers/buffers, CR team (just in case), and a porter/evacer/nuker for each group.</P><P>Since this is the main thing that I need to do to finish my epic, I would be happy to help you (and an SK and a paladin - their mobs are close to the shaman one) with Hole raid.</P><P>Juror Seraphim<BR>Mystic of the Tribunal<BR>(aka the TDHN events coordinator)<BR><img src="http://home.kscable.com/mvandoren/gat1.jpg" border=0><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

