        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Ok how about we change it to Friday the 30th, and maybe Juror you can help with class recruitment since you know more about the Hole than I do.  Of course this is just a suggestion to go there for Epics, and if it doesn't go down there is always another day.  Also I agree, I will go all night if it means a bunch of people can get epic drops, my drop is on a triggered spawn, just to let ya know.  I will keep checking and posting as we get closer, thanks.</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
