        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I'm all up for a sunday raid if you are still considering dates. (I work evenings and have sundays off.) But if friday is better for everyone I understand.<BR> <BR>Tier</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
